# Dancing Stage - Internet Ranking Ver (GC845 VER. EBA): a game, from the NVRAM dstage-install.his
# leaves (the flash installed). The flash check, the logos and the title (frame ~6600); three coins (one credit on this version),
# Start through the title, mode and song select, then the song played by stepping on all four
# panels every 8 frames: some arrows are hit, some missed. Hashes the main RAM every frame,
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game dstage

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 6700 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6740 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6780 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6900 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7500 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 8100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 8700 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 9000 every 8 press "P1 Left" 4
from 9000 every 8 press "P1 Down" 4
from 9000 every 8 press "P1 Up" 4
from 9000 every 8 press "P1 Right" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 16000 quit
